WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
In 1992,
Congress passed legislatio

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.070 size:84% position:42% line:92%
making the month of May

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
Asian Pacific American
Heritage Month.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:08.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
And here to help you celebrate
this month properly

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.877 size:88% position:44%
is one of our writers --
Karen Chee, everybody.

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:13.646 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.149 line:92%
-Hi, everybody. Seth is right.

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:18.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
Asian Pacific American
Heritage Month

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.220 line:92%
was established 27 years ago

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
but people still don't quite
know how to celebrate it.

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:26.659
So if you're a white perso
trying to join in on the fun

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:30.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've got some do's and don't
for you.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:34.034 size:88% position:44%
Number one, don't ask me
where I'm really from.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.504
Because when I say I'm fro
a suburb of San Francisco,

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:41.141 line:92%
I can tell you're disappointed

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.142 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Asian-American people

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:44.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
are descendants
of many different countries,

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is just a polite way
of saying,

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:49.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
number two,
don't say "Ni hao" to me.

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:53.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just because I'm Asian
doesn't mean I speak Chinese

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:56.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't walk up to every white
person I see and assume

00:00:56.222 --> 00:01:00.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they know where
the nearest Williams-Sonoma is

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:03.530 line:92%
I mean, they do every time..

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:06.199 size:88% position:44% line:92%
but I don't just assume.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:08.935 line:92%
Number three, do bow to me

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:11.838 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.110 line:92%
But it's not because I'm Asian

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just because
I'm cool as hell.

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:22.582 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:26.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
Number four, don't ask me
what my real name is.

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:31.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's Karen. I don't have
a secret Asian language name

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:34.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
And even if I did,
I wouldn't tell you.

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:37.230 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Because it's a secret.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.867
Number five, don't ask me
what your tattoo says.

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.535 line:92%
I can't tell you what it says.

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I can tell you
what it means --

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.607 size:78% position:39% line:92%
you make bad choices.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.476 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:53.947 line:92%
And finally, do buy me a drink

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:54.948 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's just a stereotype

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:57.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Asian people
can't drink alcohol,

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.152 line:92%
but we drink all the time!

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.421 line:92%
Hell, I'm drunk right now!

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:04.224 line:92%
Anyway, so, back to you, Seth.

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:08.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or as we say in my country
"Back to you, Seth."

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:12.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Give it up for Karen Chee
everybody!

